+    // concurrent calls for the same key (e.g. a client retry) both see "not found" and both insert,
+    // creating two records for one recipientKeyFingerprint - and findTenantRoutingRecordByRecipientKey
+    // (used on every inbound message) throws RecordDuplicateError as soon as more than one exists,
+    // permanently breaking that key. addTenantRoutingRecord now gives the record a deterministic id
+    // (the recipient key's fingerprint), so a concurrent or repeat registration collides atomically
